lines=['# Classification — KP 17592186133889','Captured database math, basis 1356, lineage '+g.SOURCE['lineage']+'. Fourteen practice questions: seven easy, seven moderate, no hard. Canonical e-9489 is curricular evidence, not a fifteenth practice question.','| Difficulty | Observed fields | Extracted source templates/banks | Plot rating |','|---|---|---|---|','| Easy | Five radio, two blank | 7 templates, 5 complete radio banks | none |','| Moderate | Seven radio | 7 templates, 7 complete radio banks | none |','| Hard | None observed; authored radio/blank | 2 authored equal-level templates | none |','Each source has an explicit parameterized scale-mask recipe. We retain separate rows when formal inputs, collection stages, evaluation stages or blank layouts differ. Uniform scale is a component parameter, but these evidence recipes do not claim recovery of distractor intent. Normal generation selects separately authored eligible banks.','| Source | Difficulty | Field | Prompt components | Original correct |','|---|---|---|---|---|']
